  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:340px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-gray pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Sin Absorption</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6a/Sin_Eater_III_001.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20150118004826\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Sin Eater III 001\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6a/Sin_Eater_III_001.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20150118004826\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6a/Sin_Eater_III_001.PNG/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20150118004826 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/6/6a/Sin_Eater_III_001.PNG/revision/latest?cb=20150118004826 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Sin Eater III 001\" width=\"270\" height=\"242\" data-image-key=\"Sin_Eater_III_001.PNG\" data-image-name=\"Sin Eater III 001.PNG\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">The Sin Eater III (Marvel Comics) had the ability to absorb the \"sins\" of others to increase his own power</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb the sins of others.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb the sins or slights upon an individual from moral actions into oneself</b>. Sub-power of <a href=\"/wiki/Morality_Manipulation\" title=\"Morality Manipulation\">Morality Manipulation</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Sin_Manipulation\" title=\"Sin Manipulation\">Sin Manipulation</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Sin Consumption/Drain</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:Sin-eater\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:en:Sin-eater\">Sin-eater</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can remove the sins from a person or object and place it into themselves. The user essentially drains the personal transgressions of others into themselves and feeds off the sins of other beings.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Evil_Empowerment\" title=\"Evil Empowerment\">Evil Empowerment</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Exorcism\" title=\"Exorcism\">Exorcism</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Malevorous\" title=\"Malevorous\">Malevorous</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Purification\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Purification\">Purification</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sin_Detection\" title=\"Sin Detection\">Sin Detection</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Morality_Manipulation\" title=\"Morality Manipulation\">Morality Manipulation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Sin_Manipulation\" title=\"Sin Manipulation\">Sin Manipulation</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Cannot effect beings who have not \"sinned\" by supposed standards.</li>\n<li>The user could be consumed/destroyed by the sins they remove and take into themselves.</li>\n<li>May not be able to feed off of their own sins.</li>\n<li>May be overloaded or corrupted if the target has committed too many sins.</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Sin_Inducement\" title=\"Eternal Sin Inducement\">Eternal Sin Inducement</a> may be to much to drain.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Pandora (<i>Mayonaka no Occult Komuin</i>)</li>\n<li>Sin Eater III (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Alex Bernier (<i>The Order</i>)</li>\n<li>William Eden (<i>The Order</i>)</li>\n<li>Satella, the Witch of Envy (<i>Re:Zero</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://sleepyhollow.fandom.com/wiki/Jeremy_Crane\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:sleepyhollow:Jeremy Crane\">Jeremy Crane</a> (<i>Sleepy Hollow</i>)</li>\n<li>Neuro Nōgami (<i>Neuro: Supernatural Detective</i>)</li>\n<li>Users of <a href=\"https://whitewolf.fandom.com/wiki/Hamartiaphage\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:whitewolf:Hamartiaphage\">Hamartiaphage</a> (<i>Vampire: The Requiem/Chronicles of Darkness</i>)</li>\n<li>Caldea's Orb (<i>Marchen Awakens Romance</i>)</li>\n<li>Sirens (<i>The Vampire Diaries</i>)</li>\n<li>Thaddeus Sivana (<i>DC Extended Universe</i>); via the Eye of Sins</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSin_Absorption%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"036b1f97619e4d859f7db1a7ba32ca29\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Result_of_Greed-jpeg\" style=\"position: relative; height:184px; width:118px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Result_of_Greed.jpeg\" title=\"Result of Greed.jpeg (36 KB)\" style=\"height:184px; width:118px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https:/